DSH-MOBILE 1.3.1
Engine: @deepseek-ai/dsh 0.2.2-rc.1
Runtime: Node.js 24.21.0 (win32-x64); cloudflared 2026.10.7
Shell: Electron (bundled)
Features: fully isolated data roots; in-app remote panel with two modes:
          - LAN (6-digit password, local IPv4 addresses)
          - Public (bundled cloudflared, trycloudflare HTTPS URL, 32-char password)
          Android remote WebUI (phone 3090); sessions sync protocol v1.
          Plugin install from npm, GitHub, any git URL and local file:
          bundled pnpm 11.28.5 + MinGit 2.56.1 in runtime\ (provision-*.ps1),
          shims independent of DSH_* so scrubbedParentEnv() still resolves them.
Built: 2026-11-12
